OL,3,GNEWSATwo people dead after workplace
OL,4,Aincident near rural road
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo people have died following what's
OL,7,Fbeen described as a workplace incident
OL,8,Fat a road in County Down.
OL,10,FEmergency services attended the scene
OL,11,Fon the Ballygowan Road in
OL,12,FCrossnacreevy.
OL,14,FIt happened at about 10:45 BST on
OL,15,FFriday.
OL,17,FThree ambulances and two hazard
OL,18,Fresponse teams were sent but no one was
OL,19,Ftaken from the scene.
